18:["$","p","A required result above 4.00 is not achievable on a standard unweighted 4.0 scale with the entered credit plan. Adding more future credits can change the estimate, but course repeats, exclusions and institutional rules may produce a different official result.",{"children":"A required result above 4.00 is not achievable on a standard unweighted 4.0 scale with the entered credit plan. Adding more future credits can change the estimate, but course repeats, exclusions and institutional rules may produce a different official result."}]
